# What scripts/release.sh signs, one per line: <path inside the release, under bin/> <identifier>
# The identifiers are frozen. The L01 keychain ACL trusts msd's designated requirement
# (identifier + Developer ID team): changing cc.morsec.msd locks every user out of their keys
# after an upgrade. packaging/tests pins these values.
# This is also the list of what ships: scripts/release.sh builds, hashes, signs and archives
# exactly these bin/ tools, the formula must install exactly these (packaging tests and
# scripts/release-check.sh check both). ms-shim (L12 run mode) must sit next to ms.
# A .app bundle would need inside-out signing; machocmp handles thin Mach-O files only.
ms cc.morsec.ms
msd cc.morsec.msd
ms-shim cc.morsec.ms-shim
